 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "お知らせを読んだ？十二日の話し合いでは決まらなかったね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D001-S01",
    "C65-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 4.388,
   "duration_sec": 4.388
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "うん。私は欠席したけど、土曜に岡本さんから聞いた。三月二十日の発表会前、十三日は全員で練習したい。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D002-S01",
    "C65-D002-S02",
    "C65-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 4.738,
   "end_sec": 14.4,
   "duration_sec": 9.662
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "三月の交流会を十三日から六日に変える案はどう？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D003-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 14.75,
   "end_sec": 18.76,
   "duration_sec": 4.01
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "六日の練習が午後でも次週に確認できるね。皆に聞こう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D004-S01",
    "C65-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 19.11,
   "end_sec": 23.999,
   "duration_sec": 4.889
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "交流会の返事は二十八日までにまとめるよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D005-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 24.349,
   "end_sec": 27.813,
   "duration_sec": 3.464
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私は今週岡本さんに相談する。一緒に一月六日までに出そう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D006-S01",
    "C65-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.163,
   "end_sec": 33.796,
   "duration_sec": 5.633
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "午後の音も調べないとね。交流会では静かな遊びを用意するよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D007-S01",
    "C65-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 34.146,
   "end_sec": 39.199,
   "duration_sec": 5.053
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "日程と音を分けて書こう。ところで、写真展の準備は？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D008-S01",
    "C65-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 39.549,
   "end_sec": 44.195,
   "duration_sec": 4.646
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "親戚から銀婚式の記念旅行の写真を借りたよ。結婚二十五年のお祝いで、ふたり連れで知らない町を歩いたんだって。熟年になって初めて二人だけで旅をしたそうだ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D009-S01",
    "C65-D009-S02",
    "C65-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 44.545,
   "end_sec": 57.118,
   "duration_sec": 12.573
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "名前は本人に確認した？私の実姉は写真を出すのに消極的だから、家族でも先に聞くよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D010-S01",
    "C65-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 57.468,
   "end_sec": 64.482,
   "duration_sec": 7.014
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "うん。姪といとこにも聞いた。説明を直してくれたよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D011-S01",
    "C65-D011-S02",
    "C65-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 64.832,
   "end_sec": 68.826,
   "duration_sec": 3.994
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "写真とのかかわりが伝わるね。言葉の誤解も防ぎたい。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D012-S01",
    "C65-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 69.176,
   "end_sec": 73.596,
   "duration_sec": 4.42
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "そう。「愛人」を配偶者の意味で書いた人がいた。日本語の「愛人」は恋人、特に婚外の相手を指すことが多いと説明したよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D013-S01",
    "C65-D013-S02",
    "C65-D013-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 73.946,
   "end_sec": 84.3,
   "duration_sec": 10.354
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "人前で「けしからん」と責めるより、静かに伝えたいね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D014-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 84.65,
   "end_sec": 88.621,
   "duration_sec": 3.971
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "うん。別の人は、国の慣わしを紹介したいんだって。故郷で彼岸に先祖を思う写真を出すそうだ。それとは別に、神棚に水を供える毎日の習慣を写した人もいる。信仰の異なる写真が入り混じる展示になるね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D015-S01",
    "C65-D015-S02",
    "C65-D015-S03",
    "C65-D015-S04",
    "C65-D015-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "short_pause"
   ],
   "start_sec": 88.971,
   "end_sec": 105.284,
   "duration_sec": 16.313
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私の親類はお坊さんで、禅僧としてお寺で働いているよ。和尚さんに正座が難しいと伝えたら、椅子を出してくれた。儀式の形より配慮を大事にしていた。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D016-S01",
    "C65-D016-S02",
    "C65-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 105.634,
   "end_sec": 117.962,
   "duration_sec": 12.328
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "そういう経験も書けるね。世の中にはいろいろな共同体がある。遅かれ早かれ摩擦は起きるけど、相手を思いやることで支えあう関係を作りたい。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D017-S01",
    "C65-D017-S02",
    "C65-D017-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 118.312,
   "end_sec": 128.874,
   "duration_sec": 10.562
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "うん。一人っ子でも大家族でも、家庭の形だけで人は判断できないね。お子さんの写真も、幼児なら何も聞かずに出してよいわけではない。親の体面のための展示にしたくないね。私は寺の写真の公開と説明を親類に確認するよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D018-S01",
    "C65-D018-S02",
    "C65-D018-S03",
    "C65-D018-S04",
    "C65-D018-S05"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 129.224,
   "end_sec": 147.497,
   "duration_sec": 18.273
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C65-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "ハサン",
   "source_text": "私は彼岸と神棚の写真を出した二人に、それぞれの習慣の説明が正しいか確かめるよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C65-D019-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-techagent-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 147.847,
   "end_sec": 154.747,
   "duration_sec": 6.9
  }
